<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>In Thy presence is fullness of joy.</l><l>In Thy presence is fullness of joy.</l><l>In Thy presence is fullness,</l><l>In Thy presence is fullness,</l><l>In Thy presence is fullness of joy.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>At Thy right hand are pleasures evermore.</l><l>At Thy right hand are pleasures evermore.</l><l>At Thy right hand are pleasures,</l><l>At Thy right hand are pleasures,</l><l>At Thy right hand are pleasures evermore.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
